{
  "name": "CRM Stage Trigger to SMS + Email Follow-Up With Exit Rules",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - CRM STAGE CHANGE COMES IN\n\nGoHighLevel or HubSpot fires a webhook when a contact moves stage. We normalize the contact so every stage below reads the same fields.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ab8ba24b-ff6a-5143-973a-3086dc7276ca",
      "name": "Section - 1 - CRM STAGE CHANGE COMES IN",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - ROUTE BY PIPELINE STAGE\n\nOne switch, one sequence per stage. Adding a stage later is one more arm, not a rebuild.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0c4803cc-5b31-58b4-9c2d-bcac15d1690c",
      "name": "Section - 2 - ROUTE BY PIPELINE STAGE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - NEW LEAD SEQUENCE: SMS, WAIT, EMAIL, WAIT\n\nInstant SMS while the lead is still warm, email an hour later, then a full day before the next check. Every delay timer is visible in its label.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "15dad32e-982d-582e-98e0-55b3a225857c",
      "name": "Section - 3 - NEW LEAD SEQUENCE: SMS, WAIT, EMAIL, WAIT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - EXIT RULES AND TOUCH CAP\n\nIf they replied or booked, the sequence stops. Otherwise one more SMS and back to the day timer, until the touch cap ends it.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "18366263-b565-5603-bd1b-7231ed184d0f",
      "name": "Section - 4 - EXIT RULES AND TOUCH CAP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2040,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - NOTIFY THE REP, WRITE BACK TO THE CRM, CATCH ERRORS\n\nThe rep sees every touch in Slack and the CRM holds the sequence state. Any failure alerts with a link to the run.",
        "height": 900,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "e573a0d4-f523-5465-b20e-f6e17ce63a03",
